The files in include/vulkan/ (vulkan_core.h, vk_platform.h) are vendored
verbatim from the Khronos Group's Vulkan-Headers repository:

    https://github.com/KhronosGroup/Vulkan-Headers

Copyright 2015-2026 The Khronos Group Inc.
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 OR MIT

They are redistributed here so that gountlet's GPU benchmark can be built
with only the Vulkan runtime loader installed, without requiring a full
Vulkan SDK on the build machine.
